# Everything in this repo runs on Linux: the container the app runs in, the
# GitHub Actions runner, the Kind node. Force LF line endings so a CRLF can
# never reach a shell script and turn `./showtime.sh` into
# "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M".
#
# This matters here specifically because I develop on Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true. Without this file git would convert every checked-out
# script to CRLF, and the failure would surface in CI rather than locally,
# which is the worse place to find it.
#
# Applies regardless of what core.autocrlf the person cloning has set.
* text=auto eol=lf
